# A binding of lba.cfg to a key that has no XT code, with GamePad
# (fixtures/rebindprint: the outside save, and its LBA.CFG ending in
# Input0_1: 44 and Input0_2: 0, Forward on Print Screen alone). In play
# Print Screen walks Twinsen forward, the record holding its virtual
# key in v lines, and Up, bound to none of the inputs, leaves him
# standing.

hold 0.15
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot scene
down Print
sleep 1.5
up Print
sleep 1
shot walked
down Up
sleep 1.5
up Up
sleep 1
shot stood
